---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Ask a Question">
  <h1>Ask a Question</h1>
  <p class="lede">
    A small demo of the <code>@askq/react</code> components: students answer questions on a lesson
    page, and every attempt is stored as its own row so a retry never overwrites an earlier answer.
  </p>

  <ul class="card-list">
    <li>
      <a href="/lessons/lesson-one">
        <strong>Lesson one</strong>
        <span>Nine questions, one of each type.</span>
      </a>
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Teacher dashboard</h2>
  <p class="lede">
    The dashboard is not linked from anywhere crawlable and is served with
    <code>noindex</code>. For this MVP the only thing protecting it is the path
    <code>/secretkey_abc123/teacher-dashboard</code> — see the README for how to put a real lock on
    it before using this with a class.
  </p>
</Base>
